<title>HUNGARY: Hungary raises gas prices.</title>
<headline>Hungary raises gas prices.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary increased prices to industrial and domestic consumers from July 1, the Energy Office said on Monday.</p>
<p>Prices to industrial and commercial users will rise 12.5 percent while prices to domestic users will increase by 9.9 percent.</p>
<p>Wholesale prices, those paid by Hungarian oil and gas company MOL for its gas supplies, mostly from Russia, will rise 13.5 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;The gas prices have been increased at higher rate due to international purchase prices,&quot; said Imre Szabo, General Director of the Energy Office.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
